ng invoke \"rows.cljc\" 689]\n   [yin.vm.ucf.rows$emit invokeStatic \"rows.cljc\" 739]\n   [yin.vm.ucf.rows$emit invoke \"rows.cljc\" 733]\n   [yin.vm.ucf.rows$emit invokeStatic \"rows.cljc\" 736]\n   [yin.vm.ucf.rows$emit invoke \"rows.cljc\" 733]\n   [yin.vm.followup_probe_test$eval21659\n    invokeStatic\n    \"followup_probe_test.clj\"\n    9]\n   [yin.vm.followup_probe_test$eval21659\n722:(defn emit-numbered\n733:(defn emit\n777:  (letfn [(literal-value\n780:              (map? x) [:map (into {} (map (fn [[k v]] [(literal-value k) (literal-value v)])) x)]\n781:              (set? x) [:set (set (map literal-value x))]\n782:              (sequential? x) [:seq (mapv literal-value x)]\n787:              :lit (literal-value (second v))\n818:                    (and (ref? d) (= :task (:kind x))) (check-task x p)\n830:          (check-task\n836:    (when (= :task (:kind root)) (check-task root []))))\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-revisions.md\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/bytecode-vm-optimization.md:336:  applied to `vm/opcase` macro expansion so CLJD could compile. Runtime\ndocs/agents/known-gaps.md:29:| Historical source prose outside the nine citation-line allowance: the optimisation note mentions the deleted `vm/opcase`; `ucf/rows/checkpoint.cljc` says it replaces the now-deleted `yin.vm.ucf.checkpoint` | 8f-1 review D1 / P3-5 | yin.vm.semantic (the register-VM track) | recorded in 8g: `vm/opcase` died in 8f-3, the old inspector in 8f-1; prose-only follow-up if desired | P3 |\n10542:Decisions: (1) Fable designed S4 as two dispatches, M4 then S4 (collab/1791222000000-architect-python-c3-s4-design). (2) The first S4 codex run hung 70 minutes on stdin with no output (I killed only my own process; codex dispatches now close stdin with < /dev/null); the second hit codex's usage cap mid-slice (132k tokens, resets 01:33), leaving unverified partial work; I handed the worktree to opus-5-5 to continue, which treated the partial diff as untrust